                        network match requires a netmask length.

     ssrrcc nneett _n_e_t        True if the IPv4/v6 source address of the packet has a
                        network number of _n_e_t.

     nneett _n_e_t            True if either the IPv4/v6 source or destination ad‐
                        dress of the packet has a network number of _n_e_t.

     nneett _n_e_t mmaasskk _n_e_t_m_a_s_k
                        True if the IPv4 address matches _n_e_t with the specific
                        _n_e_t_m_a_s_k.  May be qualified with ssrrcc or ddsstt.  Note that
                        this syntax is not valid for IPv6 networks.

