                        protocol type _p_r_o_t_o_c_o_l.  _p_r_o_t_o_c_o_l can be a number, or
                        one of the names from protocols(5), such as iiccmmpp,
                        iiccmmpp66, iiggmmpp, iiggrrpp, ppiimm, aahh, eesspp, vvrrrrpp, uuddpp, or ttccpp.
